- rezultirajući profil projektne brzine:
- the resulting profile of the projected speed V~p~ (V85) for the passenger car and heavy vehicles ({0}) under free-flow traffic conditions, for all directions of travel over the entire alignment;
- harmonisation of the alignment elements and statistical indicators of dynamic homogeneity: the mean projected speed, the standard deviation and the coefficient of dynamic homogeneity;
